<section class="x-sec wallsec" id="everything" aria-labelledby="everything-h"><div class="wrap">
  <h2 id="everything-h">One place for everything your agents make.</h2>
  <p class="x-agl">Pages, Markdown, code, PDFs and images. All versioned, all open to comments.</p>
  <div class="wgrid mwall" data-done="1" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="tile"><div class="tb">Launch plan<span>page</span></div><div class="tc"><h6>Q4 launch plan</h6><div class="ln" style="width:92%"></div><div class="ln" style="width:70%"></div><ul class="mck" style="margin-top:8px"><li class="d"><i></i>Pricing page reviewed</li><li class="d"><i></i>Docs links checked</li><li><i></i>Go or no-go call</li></ul></div></div>
        <div class="tile"><div class="tb">Release status<span>page</span></div><div class="tc"><div class="srow">Search filters <span class="pl g">shipped</span></div><div class="srow">Saved views <span class="pl w">in review</span></div><div class="srow">Dark mode <span class="pl y">building</span></div></div></div>
        <div class="tile"><div class="tb">Sync spec<span>markdown</span></div><div class="tc"><h6>How sync works</h6><div class="ln" style="width:88%"></div><div class="ln" style="width:64%"></div><div class="flow"><span>Agent</span><i></i><span>Publish</span><i></i><span>Viewer</span></div><div class="ln" style="width:76%;margin-top:9px"></div></div></div>
